                                                "sense_id": "a2306682-f11b-3722-b3b5-27cebe6f0cda",
                                                "text": "There’s a move in the islands to secede from Britain and join Norway or even Denmark — an Orkxit to follow Brexit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
